ext'=>'Ọrọ Atilẹyin ọna asopọ','Set the alt text for the linked keywords in the frontend of the site.'=>'Ṣeto ọrọ atilẹyin fun awọn ọrọ-ọrọ ti a so pọ ni iwaju aaye naa.','Custom Alt Text'=>'Ọrọ Atilẹyin Aṣ customized','Enter custom alt text for the linked keywords. This is only used if "Custom Text" is selected above.'=>'Tẹ ọrọ alt aṣa fun awọn ọrọ-ọrọ ti a so pọ. Eyi ni a lo nikan ti "Ọrọ Aṣa" ba ti yan loke.','Auto-linking'=>'Ìjápọ̀-àtọka','Redirection'=>'Ìtẹ̀síwájú','Redirection Method'=>'Ọna Ìtẹ̀síwájú','Select redirection method'=>'Yan ọ̀nà ìtẹ̀síwájú','Select a method'=>'Yan ọ̀nà kan','Mark links as sponsored content.'=>'Ṣàkóso àwọn ìjápọ gẹ́gẹ́ bí akoonu ìpolówó.','Adds rel="sponsored" attribute. Recommended for affiliate links and paid promotions.'=>'Fi àdírẹsì rel="ìpolówó" kun. A ṣe iṣeduro fún àwọn ìjápọ alafaramo àti àwọn ìpolówó tí a san.','Prevent search engines from following this link.'=>'Dènà àwọn ẹrọ ìwádìí láti tẹ̀lé ìjápọ yìí.','Adds rel="nofollow" attribute. Recommended for external links and untrusted sources.'=>'Fi àdírẹsì rel="nofollow" kun. A ṣe iṣeduro fún àwọn ìjápọ àtọka àti àwọn orísun tí a kò gbẹ́kẹ̀ lé.','Pass URL parameters to the target link.'=>'Fẹ́ ẹ̀ka URL sí ìjápọ àfojúsùn.','Any parameters added to the short URL (e.g., ?utm_source=email) will be forwarded to the target URL.'=>'Gbogbo àwọn párámetà tí a fi kun sí URL kukuru (àpẹẹrẹ: ?utm_source=email) yóò jẹ́ kí a fi ranṣẹ́ sí URL àfojúsùn.','Password Protection'=>'Ìdánilójú Ọrọ aṣínà','Secure your shortlink.'=>'Dáàbò bo ìjápọ kukuru rẹ.','Users must enter the password to redirect to the target link.'=>'Àwọn olumulo gbọdọ̀ tẹ ọrọ aṣínà wọlé láti tún ìjápọ àfojúsùn.','Password'=>'Ọrọ aṣínà','Share this with users.'=>'Pín ìyẹn pẹ̀lú àwọn olumulo.','Passwords are case sensitive.'=>'Àwọn ọrọ aṣínà jẹ́ ìmọ̀lára ọ̀rọ.','********'=>'********','Enable Expiration'=>'Mú Ìparí ṣiṣẹ́','Set an expiration date and time for shortlinks.'=>'Ṣeto ọjọ ipari ati akoko fun awọn ọna asopọ kukuru.','After the expiration date and time pass, visitors will no longer be able to access the shortlink.'=>'Lẹhin ti ọjọ ipari ati akoko ba kọja, awọn alejo ko ni ni anfani lati wọle si ọna asopọ kukuru naa.','Select the date when this shortlink should stop working.'=>'Yan ọjọ ti ọna asopọ kukuru yii yẹ ki o da working duro.','Select the time when the shortlink should expire.'=>'Yan akoko ti ọna asopọ kukuru yẹ ki o parẹ.','Must be at least 1 minute in the future. Combined with the date above to set the exact expiration moment.'=>'O gbọdọ jẹ o kere ju iṣẹju 1 ni ọjọ iwaju. Papọ pẹlu ọjọ loke lati ṣeto akoko ipari gangan.','Security'=>'Aabo','QR Code'=>'Koodu QR','Analytics'=>'Itupalẹ','Post not found.'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ ko ri.','This post is in {status} status. It is not visible to the public.'=>'Ipò ìfiranṣẹ yi wa ni ipo {status}. Kii ṣe kedere si gbogbo eniyan.','This link has expired'=>'Ọna asopọ yii ti pari','You will be redirected shortly.'=>'Iwọ yoo yipada laipẹ.','Click here if you are not redirected'=>'Tẹ nibi ti o ko ba yipada','Link Expired'=>'Ọna asopọ ti pari','This link is not active.'=>'Ọna asopọ yii ko ṣiṣẹ.','This link is expired.'=>'Ọna asopọ yii ti pari.','Incorrect password. Please try again.'=>'Ọrọigbaniwọle ti ko tọ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Password Protected Link'=>'Ọna asopọ ti o ni aabo pẹlu ọrọigbaniwọle','Enter password to continue:'=>'Tẹ ọrọigbaniwọle lati tẹsiwaju:','Submit'=>'Firanṣẹ','This link is not containing the right prefix slug.'=>'Ọna asopọ yii ko ni prefix slug to tọ.','Too many invalid shortlink requests. Please try again later.'=>'Ọpọ awọn ibeere ọna asopọ kukuru ti ko tọ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi nigbamii.','Too Many Requests'=>'Ọpọ Awọn ibeere','Invalid revision ID.'=>'ID atunṣe ti ko wulo.','Draft'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ','Pending Review'=>'N duro de Atunwo','Private'=>'Ikọkọ','Customize the notice shown for each enabled non-published status. Available placeholders: {status}, {date}, {title}.'=>'Ṣatunkọ akiyesi ti a fihan fun ọkọọkan ipo ti ko ti kọja. Awọn aaye ti o wa: {status}, {date}, {title}.','All'=>'Gbogbo','Settings'=>'Eto','Select which post statuses are accessible when visiting a PublishPress shortlink.'=>'Yan iru ipo ifiweranṣẹ wo ni a le wọle si nigba ti a ba ṣabẹwo si ọna asopọ kukuru PublishPress.','PublishPress Statuses Plugin Detected:'=>'Aami Ipo PublishPress ti wa ni awari:','To use core PublishPress statuses with Shortlinks, Please enable the Shortlinks post type in PublishPress Statuses workflow settings.'=>'Lati lo awọn ipo PublishPress ipilẹ pẹlu Awọn ọna asopọ Kukuru, Jọwọ mu iru ifiweranṣẹ Awọn ọna asopọ Kukuru ṣiṣẹ ni awọn eto ṣiṣe iṣẹ Ipo PublishPress.','Elementor Detected:'=>'Elementor ti wa ni awari:','Shortlink prefix is required for proper rendering of Elementor revisions. It is advisable to keep it enabled.'=>'A nilo prefix ọna asopọ kukuru fun itọju to pe ti awọn atunṣe Elementor. O jẹ imọran lati tọju rẹ ni mu.','TinyPress Shortlinks Notice:'=>'Ikilọ Ọna asopọ Kukuru TinyPress:','Elementor is active. Shortlink prefix has been automatically disabled, it is required for optimal compatibility with Elementor revisions.'=>'Elementor n ṣiṣẹ. Prefix ọna asopọ kukuru ti wa ni pipa laifọwọyi, o nilo fun ibamu to dara julọ pẹlu awọn atunṣe Elementor.','Published'=>'Ti a tẹjade','Shortlink Prefix'=>'Prefix Ọna asopọ Kukuru','Add a prefix between your domain name and shortlink.'=>'Fi prefix kan kun laarin orukọ agbegbe rẹ ati ọna asopọ kukuru.','Prefix Slug'=>'Prefix Slug','Custom prefix slug.'=>'Slug prefix aṣa.','This text will be added between your domain name and shortlink.'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ yii yoo wa ni afikun laarin orukọ agbegbe rẹ ati ọna asopọ kukuru.','go'=>'lọ','Keyboard Shortcut'=>'Kíkó Bọtini','Create shortlinks from anywhere inside your WordPress dashboard.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn ọna asopọ kukuru lati ibi eyikeyi ninu dashboard WordPress rẹ.','Ctrl or Cmd + /'=>'Ctrl tabi Cmd + /','Remove from Admin Bar'=>'Yọ kuro ni Bar Admin','Hide the "Shorten" button from the WordPress admin bar.'=>'Tọju bọtini "Dínkù" kuro ni bar admin WordPress.','Role Management'=>'Iṣakoso Ipa','Who Can View The All Shortlinks Screen'=>'Tani le wo iboju Gbogbo awọn ọna asopọ kukuru','Only selected user roles can view the complete list of Shortlinks.'=>'Awọn ipa olumulo ti a yan nikan ni le wo akojọ pipe ti Awọn ọna asopọ kukuru.','Who Can Create/Edit Shortlinks'=>'Tani Le Ṣẹda/Edit Awọn Kèkèké Línkì','Only selected user roles can create or edit links.'=>'Awọn ipa olumulo ti a yan nikan ni wọn le ṣẹda tabi ṣe atunṣe awọn ọna asopọ.','Who Can See Logs'=>'Tani le wo Awọn igbasilẹ','Only selected user roles can see the Analytics tab and the Logs screen.'=>'Awọn ipa olumulo ti a yan nikan ni le rii taabu Itupalẹ ati iboju Awọn igbasilẹ.','Who Can Control Settings'=>'Tani Le Ṣakoso Eto','Only selected user roles can access the Settings screen.'=>'Awọn ipa olumulo ti a yan nikan ni le wọle si iboju Eto.','Auto-Linking'=>'Akọsílẹ-Auto','Enable Auto-Linking'=>'Mú Akọsílẹ-Auto ṣiṣẹ','Automatically convert keywords to shortlinks in post content.'=>'Yipada awọn bọtini ọrọ si awọn ọna asopọ kekeke laifọwọyi ninu akoonu ifiweranṣẹ.','When enabled, keywords configured in shortlink settings will be automatically linked in your content.'=>'Nigbati a ba mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn bọtini ọrọ ti a ṣeto ninu awọn eto ọna asopọ kekeke yoo jẹ asopọ laifọwọyi ninu akoonu rẹ.','Post Types'=>'Ìru Ìwé','Where should auto-linking be applied?'=>'Nibo ni a ti gbọdọ lo iṣọpọ aifọwọyi?','Open Auto-Links In'=>'Ṣii Awọn Aso-Akọsílẹ Ni','Choose how auto-linked keywords should open.'=>'Yan bi awọn bọtini ọrọ ti a so pọ yẹ ki o ṣii.','Same tab'=>'Tẹ́ńbá àtàwọn','New tab'=>'Tẹ́ńbá tuntun','Auto-Link Color'=>'Àwọ̀ Akọsílẹ-Auto','Choose the color for auto-linked keywords.'=>'Yan awọ fun awọn bọtini ọrọ ti a so pọ.','Auto-List Links'=>'Akọsílẹ-Auto Línkì','Auto-List Shortlinks'=>'Akọsílẹ-Auto Kekèké Línkì','When enabled, shortlinks will appear in the "All Links" table based on the behavior you configure below.'=>'Nigbati o ba ti mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn ọna asopọ kukuru yoo han ninu tabili "Gbogbo Awọn ọna asopọ" da lori ihuwasi ti o ṣeto ni isalẹ.','Configure Post Types'=>'Configure Post Types','Set when links should be auto-listed for each post type'=>'Ṣeto nigbati awọn ọna asopọ yẹ ki o wa ni akojọ laifọwọyi fun ọkọọkan post type','Add post types and configure when their shortlinks should appear in the "All Links" table. Changes are saved automatically.'=>'Fikun un post types ki o si ṣeto nigbati awọn ọna asopọ kukuru wọn yẹ ki o han ninu tabili "Gbogbo Awọn ọna asopọ". Awọn ayipada ni a fipamọ laifọwọyi.','Post Status Visibility'=>'Post Status Visibility','Allowed Post Statuses'=>'Allowed Post Statuses','Unpublished Content Notice'=>'Iwe Ikilọ Akopọ Ti Ko Ti Kọja','Show a frontend notice when an internal shortlink displays a post that is not published.'=>'Fihan akiyesi ni iwaju nigbati ọna asopọ inu ba n ṣafihan ifiweranṣẹ ti ko ti kọja.','Notice Post Statuses'=>'Awọn ipo Ifiweranṣẹ Ikilọ','This notice only applies to internal shortlinks that render post content directly. External shortlinks are not affected.'=>'Iwe ikilọ yii kan si awọn ọna asopọ inu nikan ti o n ṣe afihan akoonu ifiweranṣẹ taara. Awọn ọna asopọ ita ko ni ipa.','Notice Messages'=>'Awọn ifiranṣẹ Ikilọ','Default redirection method for shortlinks'=>'Ọna atunṣe aiyipada fun awọn ọna asopọ kukuru','Mark links as sponsored content'=>'Samisi awọn ọna asopọ gẹgẹbi akoonu ti a ṣe atilẹyin','Prevent search engines from following links'=>'Dena awọn ẹrọ iṣawari lati tẹle awọn ọna asopọ','Pass URL parameters to target links'=>'Gbe awọn paramita URL si awọn ọna asopọ afojusun','Secure your shortlinks'=>'Ṣe aabo awọn ọna asopọ kukuru rẹ','Users must enter a password to redirect to the target link.'=>'Awọn olumulo gbọdọ tẹ ọrọ igbaniwọle kan lati yipada si ọna asopọ ti a fojusi.','Default Password'=>'Ọrọ igbaniwọle aiyipada','Default password for protected links'=>'Ọrọ igbaniwọle aiyipada fun awọn ọna asopọ ti a daabobo','This password will be used for links that have password protection enabled via global settings. Passwords are case sensitive.'=>'Ọrọ igbaniwọle yii yoo ṣee lo fun awọn ọna asopọ ti o ni aabo pẹlu ọrọ igbaniwọle ti a mu ṣiṣẹ nipasẹ awọn eto kariaye. Awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle jẹ ẹtọ si ọran.','Set an expiration date and time for shortlinks'=>'Ṣeto ọjọ ati akoko ipari fun awọn ọna asopọ kukuru','Select the date when this shortlink should stop working'=>'Yan ọjọ ti ọna asopọ kukuru yii yẹ ki o da ṣiṣẹ','Select the time when the shortlink should expire'=>'Yan akoko ti ọna asopọ kukuru yẹ ki o pari','Revisions'=>'Revisions','Revision Link Visibility'=>'Ihuwasi Asọye Atunṣe','When enabled, revision shortlinks will appear in the "All Shortlinks" table based on the behavior you configure below.'=>'Nigbati o ba ti mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn ọna asopọ kukuru atunṣe yoo han ninu tabili "Gbogbo Awọn ọna asopọ kukuru" da lori ihuwasi ti o ṣeto ni isalẹ.','When Revision is Created'=>'Nigbati Atunṣe ba ti ṣẹda','When Revision is Created or Link is First Used'=>'Nigbati Atunṣe ba ti ṣẹda tabi ọna asopọ ti wa ni lilo akọkọ','Show Shortlink in Revision Table'=>'Fihan Shortlink ninu Iwe Atunyẹwo','Display shortlink column when viewing revisions in PublishPress Revisions.'=>'Fihan àkọsílẹ shortlink nigba ti o n wo awọn atunṣe ni PublishPress Revisions.','Revision Visibility for Visitors'=>'Ifarahan Atunyẹwo fun Awọn Alejo','Allow logged-out visitors to view revision content via shortlinks.'=>'Jẹ ki awọn alejo ti ko wọlé wo akoonu atunṣe nipasẹ shortlinks.','By default, PublishPress Revisions blocks visitors from viewing revision previews. When enabled, revision shortlinks will render the revision content directly for logged-out visitors instead of redirecting to the preview URL.'=>'Ni aiyipada, PublishPress Revisions dènà awọn alejo lati wo awọn ayẹwo atunṣe. Nigba ti a ba mu un ṣiṣẹ, awọn shortlinks atunṣe yoo ṣe afihan akoonu atunṣe taara fun awọn alejo ti ko wọlé dipo ti yí wọn lọ si URL ayẹwo.','Dummy'=>'Dummy','No post types configured yet. Click "Add Post Type" to get started.'=>'Ko si awọn iru post ti a ti ṣeto sibẹsibẹ. Tẹ "Fi Iru Post Kún" lati bẹrẹ.','Add Post Type'=>'Fi Iru Post Kún','Log entry deleted successfully.'=>'Iwé àkọọlẹ ti pa ni aṣeyọri.','%d log entries deleted successfully.'=>'%d iwe àkọọlẹ ti pa ni aṣeyọri.','All logs have been cleared.'=>'Gbogbo awọn iwe àkọọlẹ ti wa ni mimọ.','Title'=>'Àkọlé','Details'=>'Àlàyé','Are you sure you want to delete this log entry?'=>'Ṣe o dájú pe o fẹ pa iwe àkọọlẹ yii?','View Analytics'=>'Wo Itupalẹ','Tablet'=>'Tablet','Mobile'=>'Mobile','Desktop'=>'Desktop','%1$s from %2$s visited at %3$s'=>'%1$s lati %2$s ṣabẹwo ni %3$s','%1$s visited at %2$s'=>'%1$s ṣabẹwo ni %2$s','From %1$s, visited at %2$s'=>'Lati %1$s, ṣabẹwo ni %2$s','Visited at %s'=>'Ti a ṣàbẹwò ni %s','via %s'=>'nipasẹ %s','Edit shortlink settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ eto asopọ kukuru','This post is in {status} status. It will become visible to the public on {date}.'=>'Iwe ifiweranṣẹ yii wa ni ipo {status}. Yoo di mimọ si gbogbo eniyan ni {date}.','Target url not found.'=>'URL ibi ti a ń fẹ ko ri.','Invalid URL scheme. Only http, https, ftp, ftps, and mailto are allowed.'=>'Ilana URL ti ko tọ. Nikan http, https, ftp, ftps, ati mailto ni a gba laaye.','Tiny slug could not created.'=>'A ko le ṣẹda slug kekere.','Shortlink will appear here'=>'Asopọ kukuru yoo han nibi','Enter a long URL and make a shortlink'=>'Tẹ URL gigun kan ki o ṣẹda asopọ kukuru','Long URL'=>'URL Gigun','Create Shortlink'=>'Ṣẹda Asopọ Kukuru','Reset Today\'s Analytics'=>'Tun Analytics Ọjọ́ Tó Rẹ́ Sọ́kan','Reset Week\'s Analytics'=>'Tun Analytics Ọsẹ́ Tó Rẹ́ Sọ́kan','Reset Month\'s Analytics'=>'Tun Analytics Oṣù Tó Rẹ́ Sọ́kan','Reset Year\'s Analytics'=>'Tun Analytics Ọdún Tó Rẹ́ Sọ́kan','Are you sure you want to reset the analytics for this period? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Ṣé o dájú pé o fẹ́ tun awọn analytics fun akoko yii? Iṣe yii ko le pada sẹhin.','Today'=>'Loni','Last 7 Days'=>'Ọjọ́ 7 Tó Kẹhin','Last 1 Month'=>'Oṣù 1 Tẹ́lẹ̀','Last 1 Year'=>'Ọdún 1 Tẹ́lẹ̀','If you like %1$s please leave us a %2$s rating. Thank you!'=>'Ti o ba fẹ %1$s jọwọ fi wa %2$s ìdíyelé. Ẹ ṣé!','About'=>'Nipa','Documentation'=>'Iwe aṣẹ','Contact'=>'Kan si','Download QR Code'=>'Gba Koodu QR','We have developed extensions for the below browsers.'=>'A ti ṣe idagbasoke awọn afikun fun awọn aṣawakiri ti o wa ni isalẹ.','Click on your preferred one to Download the extension.'=>'Tẹ lori ọkan ti o fẹ lati Gba afikun naa.','Download the Extension'=>'Gba afikun naa','Need PublishPress Shortlinks Support?'=>'Nilo Atilẹyin PublishPress Shortlinks?','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'Ti o ba nilo iranlọwọ tabi ni ibeere ẹya tuntun, jẹ ki a mọ.','Request Support'=>'Beere Atilẹyin','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'Iwe aṣẹ alaye tun wa lori oju opo wẹẹbu plugin naa.','View Knowledge Base'=>'Wo Ibi ìmọ','This plugin can be deleted.'=>'A le pa plugin yii run.','Copied.'=>'Ti a daakọ.','This setting is inherited from global settings. Choose another option to override it for this shortlink.'=>'Eto yii ni a gba lati awọn eto kariaye. Yan aṣayan miiran lati fi agbara mu o fun ọna asopọ kukuru yii.','Working...'=>'N ṣiṣẹ...','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(opens in a new tab)','Reports'=>'Ìròyìn','Get aggregated insights into your shortlink performance with detailed analytics reports.'=>'Gba ìmọ̀ tó pọ̀ jọ nípa iṣẹ́ ìṣàkóso rẹ pẹlu àwọn ìròyìn àlàyé pẹ̀lú ìtúpalẹ̀ tó dájú.','Date Range:'=>'Àkókò Ọjọ́:','Apply'=>'Lò','Total Clicks'=>'Gbogbo Ìkànnì','Unique Visitors'=>'Àwọn Olùbẹwo Aláìlè','Active Links'=>'Àwọn Ìkànnì Àmúlò','Avg. Clicks/Link'=>'Àgbóra. Ìkànnì/Ìkànnì','Top Performing Links'=>'Àwọn Ìkànnì Tó Ṣe Pípé','Link'=>'Ìkànnì','Clicks'=>'Ìkànnì','Top Locations'=>'Àwọn Ibi Tó Ga Jùlọ','Enable Activation'=>'Mú ìmúṣiṣẹ́ ṣiṣẹ́','Schedule when this shortlink should start working.'=>'Ṣètò ìgbà tí shortlink yìí yẹ kí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ṣiṣẹ́.','When enabled, the shortlink remains inactive until its activation date and time.'=>'Nígbà tí a bá mú ṣiṣẹ́, shortlink yìí máa wà nípasẹ̀ titi di ọjọ́ àti àkókò ìmúṣiṣẹ́ rẹ.','Activation Date'=>'Ọjọ́ Iṣẹ́','Select the date when this shortlink should start working.'=>'Yan ọjọ́ tí shortlink yìí yẹ kí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ṣiṣẹ́.','Leave empty to make the shortlink active immediately.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ kí shortlink yìí máa ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Activation Time'=>'Àkókò Iṣẹ́','Select the time when this shortlink should start working.'=>'Yan àkókò tí shortlink yìí yẹ kí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ṣiṣẹ́.','Only used when an activation date is set. Leave empty to activate at the start of that date.'=>'Níkẹyìn ni a lo nígbà tí a ba ṣètò ọjọ́ ìmúṣiṣẹ́. Fi sílẹ̀ kí o mu ṣiṣẹ́ ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ọjọ́ yẹn.','Expiration Click Limit'=>'Ìkànnì Iparun','Expire this shortlink after a number of clicks.'=>'Pẹ̀lú ìmọ̀ràn yìí, ṣẹ́sẹ̀ àkópọ̀ yìí lẹ́yìn bí a ṣe n tẹ̀ sí i.','Set to 0 for no click limit.'=>'Ṣètò sí 0 fún kò sí àkúnya tẹ́lẹ̀.','Where should visitors be sent when they click an expired link?'=>'Nibo ni a yẹ kí a rán àwọn alejo sí nígbà tí wọn bá tẹ̀siwaju ọ̀nà tó ti parí?','Custom URL'=>'URL Adani','When a shortlink expires, visitors are redirected to this URL. If left empty, visitors are redirected to the homepage.'=>'Nígbà tí shortlink bá parí, a máa rán àwọn alejo sí URL yìí. Tí a bá fi sílẹ̀, a máa rán wọn sí ojú-ìwé ìbẹ̀rẹ̀.','Display a custom notice page before redirecting expired links.'=>'Fihàn ojú-ìwé ìkìlọ̀ adani kí a tó rán àwọn ọ̀nà tó ti parí.','Expiration Notice Title'=>'Ìtẹ́sí ìkìlọ̀ Ìparí','The heading of the expiration notice page'=>'Ìtẹ́sí ojú-ìwé ìkìlọ̀ ìparí','Custom text'=>'Ọrọ̀ adani','This is the main heading visitors see when they click an expired link.'=>'Eyi ni ìtẹ́sí àkọ́kọ́ tí àwọn alejo máa rí nígbà tí wọn bá tẹ̀siwaju ọ̀nà tó ti parí.','Expiration Notice Message'=>'Ìsandẹ́ ìkìlọ̀ Ìparí','The message shown to visitors on the expiration notice page'=>'Ìsandẹ́ tí a fi hàn sí àwọn alejo lórí ojú-ìwé ìkìlọ̀ ìparí','This is the body text explaining what happened and when visitors will be redirected.'=>'Eyi ni ọrọ ara ti n ṣalaye ohun ti o ṣẹlẹ ati nigbati awọn alejo yoo ti wa ni atunṣe.','Expiration Notice Link Text'=>'Ìkìlọ̀ Ìparí Àtẹ̀jáde Ọrọ','The text for the button visitors click to continue'=>'Ọrọ fun bọtini ti awọn alejo tẹ lati tẹsiwaju','This is the text displayed on the clickable button at the bottom of the notice page.'=>'Eyi ni ọrọ ti a fihan lori bọtini ti o le tẹ ni isalẹ oju-iwe ìkìlọ̀.','Enable Dynamic Redirects'=>'Mú Àtúnrùn Dínámíkì ṣiṣẹ́','Send visitors to different destinations when they match an enabled rule.'=>'Rán awọn alejo si awọn ibi oriṣiriṣi nigbati wọn ba ba ofin ti a mu ṣiṣẹ mu.','Fallback Destination'=>'Ibi Ìpadabọ','The Target URL in the General tab is used whenever no enabled rule matches.'=>'URL ibi-afẹde ni taabu Gbogbogbo ni a lo nigbakugba ti ko si ofin ti a mu ṣiṣẹ ti o baamu.','Redirect Rules'=>'Ìlànà Àtúnrùn','Rules are checked from top to bottom. The first matching rule is used.'=>'A n ṣayẹwo awọn ofin lati oke de isalẹ. Ofin ti o baamu akọkọ ni a lo.','Add Rule'=>'Fi Ofin Kun','A shortlink can contain up to 100 redirect rules.'=>'Shortlink le ni to 100 awọn ofin atunṣe.','Redirect Rule'=>'Ofin Atunṣe','Rule Status'=>'Ipo Ofin','Rule Name'=>'Orukọ Ofin','Example: Redirect Rule 1'=>'Apeere: Ofin Atunṣe 1','Destination URL'=>'URL Ibi-afẹde','Use an HTTP or HTTPS URL. Empty, invalid, and self-referencing rules are saved as disabled.'=>'Lo URL HTTP tabi HTTPS. Kò sí, aibikita, ati awọn ofin ti ara wọn ni a fipamọ gẹgẹbi ti a ko mu ṣiṣẹ.','Countries'=>'Awọn Orilẹ-ede','Any country'=>'Ohunkohun ilẹ','Only selected countries'=>'Awọn orilẹ-ede ti a yan nikan','All except selected countries'=>'Gbogbo awọn orilẹ-ede ayafi awọn ti a yan','Selected Countries'=>'Awọn Orilẹ-ede ti a Yan','United Kingdom'=>'United Kingdom','Nigeria'=>'Nigeria','United States'=>'United States','Select countries'=>'Yan awọn orilẹ-ede','Devices'=>'Awọn Ẹrọ','Leave every option unchecked to match any device.'=>'Fi gbogbo aṣayan silẹ laisi ayẹwo lati ba ẹrọ eyikeyi mu.','Referrer'=>'Olugbala','Any referrer'=>'Eyi olugbala eyikeyi','Direct or unknown only'=>'Taara tabi aimọ nikan','Only selected domains'=>'Awọn agbegbe ti a yan nikan','All except selected domains'=>'Gbogbo ayafi awọn agbegbe ti a yan','Referrer Domains'=>'Awọn Agbegbe Olugbala','Enter domains separated by commas or new lines. Subdomains also match their parent domain.'=>'Tẹ awọn agbegbe ti a ya sọtọ nipasẹ awọn koma tabi awọn ila titun. Awọn subdomains tun ba agbegbe obi wọn mu.','Post type (row %d)'=>'Post type (row %d)','When to list shortlinks (row %d)'=>'When to list shortlinks (row %d)','Move row %d up'=>'Move row %d up','Move row %d down'=>'Move row %d down','Remove row %d'=>'Remove row %d','Row moved to position %1$d of %2$d.'=>'Row moved to position %1$d of %2$d.','Row removed.'=>'Row removed.','Copy shortlink %s'=>'Copy shortlink %s','— No Change —'=>'— No Change —','Short String'=>'Short String','Quick Edit'=>'Quick Edit','Use an http, https, ftp, ftps, or mailto URL.'=>'Use an http, https, ftp, ftps, or mailto URL.','Duplicate'=>'Duplicate','You are not allowed to duplicate this shortlink.'=>'You are not allowed to duplicate this shortlink.','Shortlink duplication failed'=>'Shortlink duplication failed','Shortlink duplication denied.'=>'Shortlink duplication denied.','The original shortlink could not be found.'=>'A ko le ri ọna asopọ kukuru atilẹba.','Duplicate of %s'=>'Duplicate of %s','The draft exists but metadata permissions prevented duplication.'=>'The draft exists but metadata permissions prevented duplication.','The draft exists but duplication was not fully confirmed.'=>'The draft exists but duplication was not fully confirmed.','Shortlink duplicated as a draft. Review it, then publish when ready.'=>'Shortlink duplicated as a draft. Review it, then publish when ready.','Remove from favorites'=>'Yọ kuro ninu awọn ayanfẹ','Add to favorites'=>'Fi kun awọn ayanfẹ','Favorites'=>'Awọn ayanfẹ','You are not allowed to favorite this shortlink.'=>'Iwọ ko gba laaye lati fi ọna asopọ kukuru yii sinu awọn ayanfẹ.','Favorite could not be updated'=>'A ko le ṣe imudojuiwọn ayanfẹ','Analytics could not be read.'=>'Analytics could not be read.','Search shortlinks'=>'Wa awọn ọna asopọ kukuru','Loading'=>'Loading','Shortlink search results'=>'Shortlink search results','1 shortlink found. Use the up and down arrow keys to choose.'=>'1 shortlink found. Use the up and down arrow keys to choose.','%d shortlinks found. Use the up and down arrow keys to choose.'=>'%d shortlinks found. Use the up and down arrow keys to choose.','Invalid custom date range.'=>'Àkókò àyípadà àṣẹ́ tí a kọ́.','Invalid uploaded file.'=>'Faili ti a gbe si ko tọ.','Please upload a valid CSV file.'=>'Jọwọ gbe faili CSV to tọ soke.','Import and export'=>'Gbigbe wọle ati gbigbe jade','Import progress'=>'Ilọsiwaju gbigbe wọle','PublishPress Shortlinks slug.'=>'PublishPress Shortlinks slug.','Copy'=>'Daakọ','Copy failed'=>'Copy failed','Enter a shortlink slug to create a shortlink URL.'=>'Tẹ sinu slug shortlink kan lati ṣẹda URL shortlink kan.','Shortlink Slug'=>'Slug Shortlink','Shortlink URL'=>'URL Shortlink','Dynamic Redirects'=>'Àtúnrùn Dínámíkì','Scheduling'=>'Ṣeto akoko','Pretty Links'=>'Àwọn Òjò Tó Dún','Import branded and affiliate links from Pretty Links.'=>'Wá àwọn àjùmọ̀ṣe àti ìjápọ̀ láti Àwọn Òjò Tó Dún.','BetterLinks'=>'Àwọn Òjò Tó Dáa','Import link redirects, slugs, and link settings from BetterLinks.'=>'Wá àwọn ìtúnrùn ìjápọ̀, slugs, àti àwọn àṣàyàn ìjápọ̀ láti Àwọn Òjò Tó Dáa.','ThirstyAffiliates'=>'ThirstyAffiliates','Import affiliate links and redirect settings from ThirstyAffiliates.'=>'Wá àwọn ìjápọ̀ alájọṣepọ̀ àti àwọn àṣàyàn àtúnrùn láti ThirstyAffiliates.','URL Shortify'=>'URL Kékèké','Import short links managed by URL Shortify.'=>'Wá àwọn kékèké ìjápọ̀ tí URL Kékèké ń ṣakoso.','LinkCentral'=>'Àkójọpọ̀ Ìjápọ̀','Import managed short links from LinkCentral.'=>'Wá àwọn kékèké ìjápọ̀ tí Àkójọpọ̀ Ìjápọ̀ ń ṣakoso.','ShortLinks Pro'=>'ShortLinks Pro','Import short links, redirects, and link options from ShortLinks Pro.'=>'Gbe wọle awọn ọna asopọ kukuru, awọn itọnisọna, ati awọn aṣayan ọna asopọ lati PublishPress.','Easy Affiliate Links'=>'Awọn ọna asopọ Alabaṣiṣẹpọ Rọrun','Import affiliate link redirects from Easy Affiliate Links.'=>'Gbe wọle awọn itọnisọna ọna asopọ alabaṣiṣẹpọ lati Awọn ọna asopọ Alabaṣiṣẹpọ Rọrun.','Simple URLs'=>'Awọn URL Rọrun','Import clean URL redirects from Simple URLs.'=>'Gbe wọle awọn itọnisọna URL mimọ lati Awọn URL Rọrun.','Affiliate Links'=>'Awọn ọna asopọ Alabaṣiṣẹpọ','Import cloaked affiliate links from Affiliate Links.'=>'Gbe wọle awọn ọna asopọ alabaṣiṣẹpọ ti a bo lati Awọn ọna asopọ Alabaṣiṣẹpọ.','Migration'=>'Iṣipopada','Migration is running...'=>'Iṣipopada n ṣiṣẹ...','Migration complete.'=>'Iṣipopada ti pari.','Migration failed.'=>'Iṣipopada kuna.','Deactivate %s'=>'Pa %s','PublishPress Shortlinks:'=>'Awọn ọna asopọ Kukuru PublishPress:','We detected %s. You can review migration options for existing links.'=>'A ti ri %s. O le ṣe ayẹwo awọn aṣayan iṣipopada fun awọn ọna asopọ to wa.','Review Migration Options'=>'Ṣe ayẹwo Awọn aṣayan Iṣipopada','Remind me later'=>'Ranti mi nigbamii','Dismiss'=>'Kọ silẹ','You do not have permission to access this page.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ lati wọle si oju-iwe yii.','Already using another link management tool? Review detected plugins and prepare your existing links for import into PublishPress Shortlinks.'=>'Ṣe o ti n lo irinṣẹ iṣakoso ọna asopọ miiran? Ṣe ayẹwo awọn afikun ti a ri ati mura awọn ọna asopọ rẹ to wa fun gbigbe wọle si Awọn ọna asopọ Kukuru PublishPress.','%d supported migration source(s) detected.'=>'%d orisun iṣipopada ti a ṣe atilẹyin ni a ti ri.','No supported active link management plugins were detected on this site.'=>'Ko si awọn afikun iṣakoso ọna asopọ ti a ṣe atilẹyin ti a ṣe awari lori aaye yii.','Already have a CSV export from %s? Use Import Tools to upload and preview it before importing.'=>'Ṣe o ti ni CSV ti a gbejade lati %s? Lo Awọn irinṣẹ Import lati gbe wọle ki o ṣe afihan rẹ ṣaaju ki o to wọle.','Migrate'=>'Gbigbe','Direct migration unavailable'=>'Gbigbe taara ko si','Open Import Tools'=>'Ṣii Awọn irinṣẹ Import','Migration source is not active.'=>'Ibi ti igbasilẹ ko ni agbara.','Direct migration is not available for this plugin yet. Please use Import Tools with a CSV export.'=>'Gbigbe taara ko si fun afikun yii sibẹsibẹ. Jọwọ lo Awọn irinṣẹ Import pẹlu CSV ti a gbejade.','Missing target URL.'=>'URL ibi ti o padanu.','Missing shortlink slug.'=>'Slug ọna asopọ kukuru ti o padanu.','Could not create shortlink.'=>'Ko le ṣẹda ọna asopọ kukuru.','Default Target'=>'Ibi ti o yan','Redirecting automatically in %s seconds.'=>'Redirecting automatically in %s seconds.','Stop redirect'=>'Stop redirect','Automatic redirect stopped.'=>'Automatic redirect stopped.','Settings sections'=>'Apakan eto','Search settings'=>'Wa eto','Search post types'=>'Wa awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ','Filter post types...'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ...','No post types match your search.'=>'Ko si awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ti o baamu iwadii rẹ.','No data available.'=>'Ko si data ti o wa.','Select which post types will have shortlinks available.'=>'Yan iru ifiweranṣẹ wo ni yoo ni awọn ọna asopọ kukuru ti o wa.','Shortlinks metabox and column will only appear on selected post types.'=>'Awọn metabox ọna asopọ kukuru ati ọwọn nikan yoo han lori awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a yan.','Select all logs'=>'Yan gbogbo awọn igbasilẹ','Select log entry %d'=>'Yan igbasilẹ log %d','Dynamic Redirect'=>'Iṣatunṣe Iṣipopada','Redirected by %s'=>'Ti yipada nipasẹ %s','Copy shortlink'=>'Copy shortlink','Shortlink slug'=>'Shortlink slug','Enter a shortlink slug.'=>'Enter a shortlink slug.','The Shortlink exists but metadata authorization prevented setup.'=>'The Shortlink exists but metadata authorization prevented setup.','Find Shortlink categories'=>'Find Shortlink categories','List native link categories with their current revision.'=>'List native link categories with their current revision.','Create or update a Shortlink category'=>'Create or update a Shortlink category','Use native taxonomy controls and permissions. Read expected_hash from list-categories before editing; omitted fields are preserved.'=>'Use native taxonomy controls and permissions. Read expected_hash from list-categories before editing; omitted fields are preserved.','Set Shortlink categories'=>'Set Shortlink categories','Replace native category assignments with an explicit integer list. [] clears assignments; use the current get-link revision.'=>'Replace native category assignments with an explicit integer list. [] clears assignments; use the current get-link revision.','Set my Shortlink favorite'=>'Ṣeto ayanfẹ Shortlink mi','Set favorite true or false for the connected user only. Read the current get-link revision first.'=>'Ṣeto ayanfẹ otitọ tabi iro fun olumulo ti a so mọ. Ka atunṣe get-link lọwọlọwọ akọkọ.','Update multiple Shortlinks'=>'Ṣ更新多 Shortlinks','Preflight up to 20 existing links before any writes. Linked source targets must not overlap. Each item uses the original get-link revision. Native writes are not transactional: inspect complete, applied_ids and failed_id. dry_run previews all items.'=>'Ṣayẹwo titi de 20 awọn ọna asopọ to wa tẹlẹ ṣaaju ki eyikeyi awọn kikọ. Awọn ibi-afẹde orisun ti a so ko gbọdọ fi ọwọ kan. Kọọkan nkan nlo atunṣe get-link atilẹba. Awọn kikọ abinibi ko jẹ iṣowo: ṣayẹwo pipe, applied_ids ati failed_id. dry_run n ṣe afihan gbogbo awọn nkan.','Delete a Shortlink category'=>'Pa ẹka Shortlink kan','Delete a native category without deleting its links. Authorize every affected link and child category; read the current category revision first.'=>'Pa ẹka abinibi kan laisi piparẹ awọn ọna asopọ rẹ. Funni ni aṣẹ fun gbogbo ọna asopọ ti o kan ati ẹka ọmọ; ka atunṣe ẹka lọwọlọwọ akọkọ.','Read Shortlink click counts'=>'Ka awọn iroyin tite Shortlink','Read native daily chart counts and reset revision for one readable link. Visitor IPs, user identifiers, referrers and raw request logs are excluded.'=>'Ka awọn iroyin chart ọjọgbọn abinibi ati tun atunṣe fun ọna asopọ kan ti o le ka. Awọn IP alejo, awọn idanimọ olumulo, awọn itọkasi ati awọn igbasilẹ ibeere aise ni a yọkuro.','Reset Shortlink chart counts'=>'Tun awọn iroyin chart Shortlink pada','Mark this link analytics cleared through the native reset service. Audit logs remain. Requires current analytics expected_hash, analytics and object edit permissions. dry_run previews.'=>'Samisi awọn iroyin ọna asopọ yii ti a ti sọ di mimọ nipasẹ iṣẹ atunṣe abinibi. Awọn igbasilẹ ayẹwo wa. Beere fun awọn iroyin lọwọlọwọ expected_hash, analytics ati awọn aṣẹ ṣiṣatunkọ ohun. dry_run n ṣe afihan.','Read saved Shortlink health'=>'Ka ilera Shortlink ti a fipamọ','Read the native Pro health status and response code for one readable link. Does not perform HTTP requests.'=>'Ka ipo ilera Pro abinibi ati koodu idahun fun ọna asopọ kan ti o le ka. Ko ṣe awọn ibeere HTTP.','Check Shortlink health'=>'Ṣayẹwo ilera Shortlink','Run the active native Pro link checker for an editable link and store its result. Native URL safety and type settings apply. Requires current get-link expected_hash. dry_run does not request destinations.'=>'Ṣiṣẹ aṣawakiri ọna asopọ Pro abinibi ti n ṣiṣẹ fun ọna asopọ ti o le satunkọ ki o si fipamọ abajade rẹ. Aabo URL abinibi ati awọn eto iru lo wa. Beere fun awọn iroyin lọwọlọwọ expected_hash. dry_run ko beere fun awọn ibi-afẹde.','Read a post Shortlink'=>'Ka Shortlink kan','Read the native editor Short String for an enabled post type without generating a URL or changing metadata.'=>'Ka String Kukuru Ẹrọ abinibi fun iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a mu ṣiṣẹ laisi ṣiṣe URL tabi yipada metadata.','Set a post Short String'=>'Ṣeto String Kukuru ifiweranṣẹ kan','Update an enabled post native Short String, preserving other metabox values. All auto-listed mirror links need permission and are included in the revision. dry_run previews.'=>'Ṣatunkọ String Kukuru abinibi ti a mu ṣiṣẹ, fipamọ awọn iye metabox miiran. Gbogbo awọn ọna asopọ mirror ti a akojọ laifọwọyi nilo aṣẹ ati pe a ni imọran ninu atunṣe. dry_run n ṣe afihan.','Set Shortlink publication status'=>'Ṣeto ipo atẹjade Shortlink','Change a native link to publish, draft, pending or private with the current revision and native publication permissions. Source-linked records retain their native source lifecycle.'=>'Yipada ọna asopọ abinibi kan si atẹjade, iwe, ni idaduro tabi ikọkọ pẹlu atunṣe lọwọlọwọ ati awọn aṣẹ atẹjade abinibi. Awọn igbasilẹ ti a so mọ orisun tọju igbesi aye orisun abinibi wọn.','Duplicate a Shortlink to a draft'=>'Daakọ Shortlink kan si iwe','Use the native Duplicate service with a new Short String and the connected user as author. Requires source edit/read, category assignment and create permissions. No password values are returned. dry_run previews without creating a draft.'=>'Lo iṣẹ Daakọ abinibi pẹlu String Kukuru tuntun ati olumulo ti a so mọ gẹgẹbi onkọwe. Beere fun aṣẹ ṣiṣatunkọ/orin, ipin ẹka ati ṣẹda. Ko si awọn iye ọrọigbaniwọle ti a pada. dry_run n ṣe afihan laisi ṣẹda iwe.','Clear the native autolink cache'=>'Mimu iranti autolink abinibi','Invalidate native Pro autolink rules without changing links or settings. Requires native manage_options and Shortlinks settings permission. dry_run previews.'=>'Fagile awọn ofin autolink Pro abinibi laisi yipada awọn ọna asopọ tabi awọn eto. Beere fun aṣẹ iṣakoso_options abinibi ati awọn eto Shortlinks. dry_run n ṣe afihan.','Read a Shortlinks report summary'=>'Ka akopọ iroyin Shortlinks kan','Read native Pro totals, distinct visitor counts and averages for up to 20 explicit readable links between start_date and end_date (YYYY-MM-DD). No IPs, account IDs, referrers or request URLs are returned. Native report totals include retained logs after chart resets.'=>'Ka awọn akopọ Pro abinibi, awọn nọmba alejo alailẹgbẹ ati awọn apapọ fun titi de 20 awọn ọna asopọ ti o le ka laarin start_date ati end_date (YYYY-MM-DD). Ko si awọn IP, awọn ID akọọlẹ, awọn itọkasi tabi awọn URL ibeere ti a pada. Awọn akopọ iroyin abinibi pẹlu awọn igbasilẹ ti a tọju lẹhin atunṣe awọn iroyin.','Read Shortlinks settings'=>'Ka awọn eto Shortlinks','Discover exact native settings, choices and defaults. Passwords, license data and unsupported native controls are excluded. Booleans are JSON booleans, IDs integers, selections strings and lists arrays.'=>'Ṣawari awọn eto abinibi gangan, awọn yiyan ati awọn aiyipada. Awọn ọrọigbaniwọle, data iwe-aṣẹ ati awọn iṣakoso abinibi ti ko ni atilẹyin ni a yọkuro. Awọn boolean jẹ boolean JSON, awọn ID ni awọn integers, awọn yiyan jẹ awọn okun ati awọn atokọ jẹ awọn akojọpọ.','Update Shortlinks settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn eto Shortlinks','Patch discovered fields using their exact schemas and current expected_hash. Omitted settings and secrets remain unchanged. dry_run previews native sanitized values.'=>'Pade awọn aaye ti a ṣe awari nipa lilo awọn aṣa gangan wọn ati expected_hash lọwọlọwọ. Awọn eto ti a yọkuro ati awọn aṣiri wa ni iwọntunwọnsi. dry_run n ṣe afihan awọn iye ti a sọ di mimọ.','Find Shortlinks'=>'Wa Shortlinks','List readable Shortlinks by title or status. Returns IDs and labels only; use get-link to inspect configuration.'=>'Akojọ awọn Shortlinks ti o le ka nipasẹ akọle tabi ipo. Pada awọn ID ati awọn afi nikan; lo get-link lati ṣayẹwo iṣeto.','Read a Shortlink'=>'Ka Shortlink kan','Read native per-link fields and current expected_hash; omit id to discover defaults. No link passwords, raw visitor IPs or user-agent logs are returned.'=>'Ka awọn aaye per-link abinibi ati expected_hash lọwọlọwọ; yọkuro id lati wa awọn aiyipada. Ko si awọn ọrọigbaniwọle ọna asopọ, awọn IP alejo aise tabi awọn igbasilẹ olumulo-agbegbe ti a pada.','Create or update a Shortlink'=>'Ṣẹda tabi ṣatunkọ Shortlink kan','Create a published Shortlink with target_url and label, or patch id with current expected_hash. Native redirect, expiration, autolink and active Pro controls use discovered fields. All related source posts must be editable. dry_run previews. No destination URLs are fetched.'=>'Ṣẹda Shortlink ti a tẹjade pẹlu target_url ati afi, tabi ṣe atunṣe id pẹlu expected_hash lọwọlọwọ. Awọn atunṣe abinibi, ipari, autolink ati awọn iṣakoso Pro ti n ṣiṣẹ lo awọn aaye ti a ṣe awari. Gbogbo awọn ifiweranṣẹ orisun ti o ni ibatan gbọdọ jẹ satunkọ. dry_run n ṣe afihan. Ko si awọn URL ibi-afẹde ti a fa.','Trash, restore or delete a Shortlink'=>'Kọ, tunṣe tabi pa Shortlink kan','Native Shortlink lifecycle; permanent deletion requires prior trash. Requires current expected_hash and native deletion permission. dry_run previews.'=>'Igbesi aye Shortlink abinibi; piparẹ tootọ nilo idasilẹ tẹlẹ. Beere fun expected_hash lọwọlọwọ ati aṣẹ piparẹ abinibi. dry_run n ṣe afihan.','Narrow the search or use native administration for more than 1,000 links.'=>'Fa iwadi naa tabi lo iṣakoso abinibi fun diẹ ẹ sii ju 1,000 awọn ọna asopọ.','Revision destinations and routing follow the native revision workflow.'=>'Awọn ibi-afẹde atunṣe ati ọkọ oju-omi tẹle ilana iṣẹ atunṣe abinibi.','Supply target_url for a new Shortlink.'=>'Pese target_url fun Shortlink tuntun.','Use a nonempty short path with letters, numbers, dashes or underscores.'=>'Lo ọna kukuru ti ko ni ofo pẹlu awọn lẹta, awọn nọmba, awọn dashes tabi awọn underscore.','The short path is unavailable.'=>'Ọna kukuru naa ko si.','This label choice is not available for the destination.'=>'Aiyipada yiyan aami yii ko si fun ibi-afẹde naa.','The post exists but metadata permissions changed. Read before retrying.'=>'Iwe ifiweranṣẹ wa ṣugbọn awọn aṣẹ metadata ti yipada. Ka ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju.','Manage linked source records in native administration.'=>'Ṣakoso awọn igbasilẹ orisun ti a so pọ ni iṣakoso abinibi.','Read the current lifecycle state first.'=>'Ka ipin igbesi aye lọwọlọwọ akọkọ.','Unknown Shortlink category.'=>'Ẹka Shortlink ti a ko mọ.','Supply a category name.'=>'Pese orukọ ẹka kan.','Use an existing parent without a cycle.'=>'Lo obi to wa laisi iyipo.','Bulk short paths must be unique.'=>'Awọn ọna kukuru pọ gbọdọ jẹ alailẹgbẹ.','Bulk targets and linked source records must not overlap.'=>'Awọn ibi-afẹde pọ ati awọn igbasilẹ orisun ti a so pọ ko gbọdọ ṣe idapọ.','Use native administration for this category scope.'=>'Lo iṣakoso abinibi fun iwọn ẹka yii.','Use native analytics for more than 1,000 daily records.'=>'Lo itupalẹ abinibi fun awọn igbasilẹ ọjọ diẹ ẹ sii ju 1,000 lọ.','Use native analytics for this destination scope.'=>'Lo itupalẹ abinibi fun iwọn ibi-afẹde yii.','Analytics changed; read it again before resetting.'=>'Itupalẹ ti yipada; ka lẹẹkansi ṣaaju ki o to tun ṣeto.','This link type is disabled in native Link Health settings.'=>'Iru ọna asopọ yii ti wa ni pipade ninu awọn eto Ilera Link abinibi.','Native source mirrors could not be safely read.'=>'Awọn mirror orisun abinibi ko le ka ni aabo.','The source or a mirror changed; read it again.'=>'Orisun tabi mirror ti yipada; ka lẹẹkansi.','Use a nonempty short path.'=>'Lo ọna kukuru ti ko ni ofo.','This short path is unavailable.'=>'Ọna kukuru yii ko si.','Duplicate revision-linked records through the native revision workflow.'=>'Daakọ awọn igbasilẹ ti o ni asopọ pẹlu atunṣe nipasẹ ilana atunṣe abinibi.','Use valid native report dates in YYYY-MM-DD format.'=>'Lo awọn ọjọ iroyin abinibi to wulo ni ọna kika YYYY-MM-DD.','The report end date must not precede its start.'=>'Ọjọ ipari iroyin ko gbọdọ kọja ọjọ ibẹrẹ rẹ.','Native report data could not be read.'=>'Data iroyin abinibi ko le ka.','PublishPress plugin actions.'=>'Awọn iṣe plugin PublishPress.','Supply each native list identifier only once.'=>'Pese idanimọ akojọ abinibi kọọkan ni ẹẹkan nikan.','Use the native date or time format returned by discovery.'=>'Lo ọna kika ọjọ tabi akoko abinibi ti a pada nipasẹ iwari.','A native field validator rejected this value.'=>'Validator aaye abinibi kan kọ ọpọlọ yii.','Use the exact fields, types and choices returned by discovery.'=>'Lo awọn aaye, awọn iru ati awọn yiyan ti o pe ni a pada nipasẹ iwari.','You do not have permission to use this Shortlinks operation.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati lo iṣẹ Shortlinks yii.','Invalid JSON type at %s.'=>'Iru JSON ti ko tọ ni %s.','Shortlinks could not complete this operation. Inspect the current state before retrying; some changes may have been saved.'=>'Shortlinks ko le pari iṣẹ yii. Ṣayẹwo ipin lọwọlọwọ ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju; diẹ ninu awọn ayipada le ti wa ni fipamọ.','This object changed. Read it again before saving.'=>'Nkan yii ti yipada. Ka lẹẹkansi ṣaaju ki o to fipamọ.','The operation could not be fully confirmed. Read the object before retrying; some changes may have been saved.'=>'Iṣẹ naa ko le jẹrisi ni kikun. Ka nkan naa ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju; diẹ ninu awọn ayipada le ti wa ni fipamọ.','(has errors)'=>'(ni awọn aṣiṣe)','Help'=>'Iranlọwọ','Settings not saved. Please fix the highlighted errors.'=>'Awọn eto ko ti fipamọ. Jọwọ ṣe atunṣe awọn aṣiṣe ti a ṣe afihan.','Create a Shortlink'=>'Ṣẹda Shortlink kan','Reset Yesterday\'s Analytics'=>'Tunṣe Análítíks Ọjọ́lọ́ọ́dún Tí Kò Ṣeéṣe','Reset Last 30 Days Analytics'=>'Tunṣe Análítíks Ọjọ́ 30 Tí Kò Ṣeéṣe','Reset Last Month\'s Analytics'=>'Tunṣe Análítíks Oṣù Tí Kò Ṣeéṣe','Reset Last 2 Years Analytics'=>'Tunṣe Análítíks Ọdún 2 Tí Kò Ṣeéṣe','Reset Custom Range Analytics'=>'Tunṣe Análítíks Iwọn Aṣ customized','Reset All Time Analytics'=>'Tunṣe Análítíks Gbogbo Àkókò','Showing data from %1$s to %2$s'=>'Fífihan data lati %1$s si %2$s','Analytics updated. Total clicks: %1$s. Unique visitors: %2$s. Days with clicks: %3$s. Average per click day: %4$s.'=>'Atunṣe Analytics. Gbogbo tẹ: %1$s. Awọn alejo alailẹgbẹ: %2$s. Awọn ọjọ pẹlu tẹ: %3$s. Apapọ fun ọjọ tẹ: %4$s.','No click data available for this period.'=>'Ko si data titẹ silẹ ti o wa fun akoko yii.','click'=>'titẹ','clicks'=>'titẹ silẹ','Clicks over time'=>'Awọn ikọlu lori akoko','Yesterday'=>'Ana','Last 30 Days'=>'Ọjọ́ 30 Tí Kò Ṣeéṣe','This Month'=>'Oṣù yii','Last Month'=>'Oṣù Tí Kò Ṣeéṣe','This Year'=>'Ọdún yii','Last 2 Years'=>'Ọdún 2 Tí Kò Ṣeéṣe','Custom Range'=>'Iwọn Aṣ customized','All Time'=>'Gbogbo Akoko','From:'=>'Lati:','To:'=>'Si:','Days With Clicks'=>'Ọjọ Pẹlu Awọn Tẹ','Avg. per Click Day'=>'Àwọn Àkóónú. fun Ọjọ Tẹ','Clicks Over Time'=>'Àwọn Tẹ Ní Àkókò','five-star'=>'marun-star','PublishPress (opens in a new tab)'=>'PublishPress (yi n ṣii ninu taabu tuntun)','QR code for this shortlink'=>'QR koodu fun shortlink yi','PublishPress Shortlinks Free requires PHP 8.2 or newer. The plugin cannot run until PHP is updated.'=>'PublishPress Shortlinks Free nilo PHP 8.2 tabi tuntun. Ẹrọ afikun naa ko le ṣiṣẹ titi PHP yoo fi ni imudojuiwọn.','PublishPress Shortlinks Free requires WordPress 6.7 or newer. The plugin cannot run until WordPress is updated.'=>'PublishPress Shortlinks Free nilo WordPress 6.7 tabi tuntun. Ẹrọ afikun naa ko le ṣiṣẹ titi WordPress yoo fi ni imudojuiwọn.','Shortlink created:'=>'Shortlink ti ṣẹda:','The shortlink could not be created. Please try again.'=>'A ko le ṣẹda shortlink. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','No matching settings'=>'Ko si eto ti o baamu','Try a different keyword or clear the search to see all settings.'=>'Gbiyanju ọrọ-ọrọ miiran tabi nu iwadii lati wo gbogbo eto.','1 matching setting'=>'1 eto ti o baamu','%d matching settings'=>'%d eto ti o baamu']];